Description: ASCOM Alpaca HTTP server for astronomical devices
 AlpacaBridge provides an ASCOM Alpaca-compatible HTTP server supporting
 cameras (ZWO ASI, QHY), mounts (iOptron, SynScan/Celestron), focusers,
 filter wheels, rotators, and weather stations via the Alpaca protocol.
 .
 Includes bundled vendor SDKs, udev rules, and QHY firmware for
 plug-and-play USB device access. Runs as the alpacabridge system user
 and starts automatically via systemd on each boot.
 .
 Open the Alpaca management interface at http://localhost:6800/management/
 and the device API at http://localhost:6800/ after installation.
